OL,3,CThousands evacuated in Greece as
OL,4,Cstrong winds fuel wildfires across
OL,5,CEurope
OL,7,FWildfires continue to burn across
OL,8,Fseveral areas in Greece, including the
OL,9,Fcentral region Viotia, the Crete city
OL,10,FRethymno and on the island of Paros -
OL,11,FITV News reporter Isla Todd has the
OL,12,Flatest
OL,14,FThousands have been evacuated across
OL,15,FGreece as more than 70 wildfires
OL,16,Fcontinue to rage across the country.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
