OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785590299
OL,3,CThousands evacuated in Greece as
OL,4,Cstrong winds fuel wildfires across
OL,5,CEurope
OL,7,FA fire, which has been burning since
OL,8,FWednesday in southern Rethymno, Crete,
OL,9,Fspread rapidly, burning agricultural
OL,10,Fland, crops, homes and livestock, and
OL,11,Fforcing thousands to be evacuated from
OL,12,Fseveral villages.
OL,14,FMore than 200 firefighters continue to
OL,15,Ftackle more than 70 blazes across
OL,16,FGreece, the fire department confirmed
OL,17,Fin an emergency briefing on Friday.
OL,19,FThree firefighters have died battling
OL,20,Fblazes fueled by hot, dry conditions
OL,21,Fand strong winds.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
