FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785590299
OL,3,CThousands evacuated in Greece as
OL,4,Cstrong winds fuel wildfires across
OL,5,CEurope
OL,7,FGreece's Civil Protection issued
OL,8,Fwarnings to the public as huge flames
OL,9,Fwere seen scorching in Viotia.
OL,11,FLocals ploughed fields to create
OL,12,Ffirebreaks and beat back flames by
OL,13,Fhand with tree branches as the fire
OL,14,Ftore through dry vegetation.
OL,16,FHelicopters and other aircraft have
OL,17,Fbeen deployed to tackle the blaze, but
OL,18,Fstrong winds grounded a water-dumping
OL,19,Faircraft, hindering extinguishing
OL,20,Fefforts.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
