PN,31804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785590299
OL,3,CThousands evacuated in Greece as
OL,4,Cstrong winds fuel wildfires across
OL,5,CEurope
OL,7,FOn the islands of Crete, Paros, and
OL,8,FAndro, 13 villages have been evacuated
OL,9,Fdue to wildfires, according to Greek
OL,10,Freports media reports on Thursday.
OL,12,FOn Friday, 500 more people, mainly
OL,13,Ftourists, were evacuated by sea and
OL,14,Fland after being trapped in wildfires
OL,15,Fin Agios Vasileios, central Greece.
OL,17,FA forest fire continues to burn in the
OL,18,FPeloponnese peninsula region of
OL,19,Fsouthern Greece, cloaking Corinthia in
OL,20,Fthick smoke.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
