PN,31805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785590299
OL,3,CThousands evacuated in Greece as
OL,4,Cstrong winds fuel wildfires across
OL,5,CEurope
OL,7,FResidents were evacuated from Fichtia
OL,8,Fand Borsa and taken to the city of
OL,9,FArgos, according to reports from Greek
OL,10,Fmedia ERT.
OL,12,FERT also reports two elderly people
OL,13,Fwere taken to Argos General Hospital
OL,14,Fwith respiratory problems.
OL,16,FMoires Stadium in the Crete capital of
OL,17,FHeraklion has been converted to
OL,18,Fprovide temporary shelter for evacuees
OL,19,Fon the island.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
