OL,3,CThousands evacuated in Greece as
OL,4,Cstrong winds fuel wildfires across
OL,5,CEurope
OL,7,FElsewhere in Europe, firefighters
OL,8,Fcontinue to tackle blazes in the
OL,9,FItaly, Spain, Germany and Turkey.
OL,11,FIn Spain aircraft and ground crews are
OL,12,Ffighting to control a number of
OL,13,Fwildfires near Madrid, Avila and in
OL,14,Fthe Castellon regions.
OL,16,FHundred of firefighters battled
OL,17,Fwildfires in southwestern Turkey as
OL,18,Fhigh winds complicate efforts.
