OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785590299
OL,3,CThousands evacuated in Greece as
OL,4,Cstrong winds fuel wildfires across
OL,5,CEurope
OL,7,FTurkey has seen more than 70 fires
OL,8,Fsince Wednesday, but authorities say
OL,9,Fthe majority are under control.
OL,11,FIn Germany a state of emergency was
OL,12,Fdeclared in the region of
OL,13,FGohrischheide, on the border between
OL,14,Fthe eastern states of Saxony and
OL,15,FBrandenburg.
OL,17,FThere are concerns the fire will
OL,18,Fspread onto military training land
OL,19,Fwhere there is a risk of buried
OL,20,Fammunition.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
