OL,3,CThousands evacuated in Greece as
OL,4,Cstrong winds fuel wildfires across
OL,5,CEurope
OL,7,FWildfires which broke out in six
OL,8,Flocations across the Netherlands on
OL,9,FThursday, mainly on military training
OL,10,Fground, have now been contained.
OL,12,FIn France 84,000 people were told they
OL,13,Fcould return to their homes on
OL,14,FThursday after a monster wildfire
OL,15,Fdevastated 42,000 hectares west of
OL,16,FBordeaux, an area four times the size
OL,17,Fof Paris.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
