PN,31809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785590299
OL,3,CThousands evacuated in Greece as
OL,4,Cstrong winds fuel wildfires across
OL,5,CEurope
OL,7,FHollywood star George Clooney wrote to
OL,8,Fhis local mayor to say his family had
OL,9,Fevacuated the southeastern French town
OL,10,Fwhere they settled.
OL,12,F"We have no idea whether our beautiful
OL,13,Fhome makes it through this terrible
OL,14,Fmoment," Clooney said in a statement
OL,15,Fvia his publicist.
OL,17,FStrong winds and dry, hot conditions
OL,18,Fare exacerbating wildfires and
OL,19,Fhindering firefighting operations
OL,20,Fthroughout Europe.
